              "creation_time": "2026-05-08T12:30:43Z",
              "creator": "mbalfanz@mozilla.com",
              "id": 18071968,
              "is_private": false,
              "raw_text": "via #firefox-ios:\n\nReporter tried to sign up for wise.com. most of the signup work, until they were asked to take a photo of themself to confirm it matched the ID document. They received the attached screen instructing to use Chrome or Safari. Start the process all over again in Chrome worked.\n\nlooks like this might come down to facetec.com being the issue, which (for some reason) doesn't support Firefox. See https://dev.facetec.com/compatibility",
              "reactions": {},
              "tags": [],
              "text": "Created attachment 9584519\nimage(1).png\n\nvia #firefox-ios:\n\nReporter tried to sign up for wise.com. most of the signup work, until they were asked to take a photo of themself to confirm it matched the ID document. They received the attached screen instructing to use Chrome or Safari. Start the process all over again in Chrome worked.\n\nlooks like this might come down to facetec.com being the issue, which (for some reason) doesn't support Firefox. See https://dev.facetec.com/compatibility",
              "time": "2026-05-08T12:30:43Z"
            },
